---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | S N Bajaj And Co, Chartered Accountants Surat"
  description="Privacy Policy of S N Bajaj And Co — Chartered Accountants in Surat. Learn how we safeguard client financial records, PAN, GSTIN data, and communications."
  canonical="/privacy-policy"
>
  <Header />

  <article class="section" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; padding: 130px 10% 80px; gap: 40px;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Header -->
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 30px;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #718096; margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--primary-color);">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </div>
      <span style="color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 0.95rem; text-transform: uppercase;">
        Legal & Compliance
      </span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-top: 8px;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #718096; margin-top: 8px;">
        Last Updated: October 2026 • Applicable to all website visitors and client engagements
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro Card -->
    <div style="background: #f7fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-color); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px; color: #2d3748; margin: 0;">
        <strong>S N Bajaj And Co. (Chartered Accountants)</strong> is committed to preserving the confidentiality, integrity, and security of your personal, financial, and tax information. In compliance with the <em>Chartered Accountants Act 1949</em>, ICAI Code of Ethics, the <em>Information Technology Act 2000</em>, and the <em>Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023</em>, this Privacy Policy explains our data collection and handling practices.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 35px; color: #2d3748; font-size: 16px; line-height: 28px;">
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          1. Practice Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          S N Bajaj And Co. is a firm of Chartered Accountants registered with the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI), operating at 2007, Trade House, Opp. Man Darwaja Fire Station, Ring Road, Surat - 395002, Gujarat, India. CA Sanjay Bajaj is the proprietor/principal partner overseeing statutory engagements, tax advisory, audits, and business compliance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>When you consult with us, request services, or submit inquiries through snbajaj.com, we may collect:</p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li><strong>Contact & Identification Details:</strong> Full Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Business Name, Postal Address.</li>
          <li><strong>Statutory Tax Credentials:</strong> Permanent Account Number (PAN), Goods and Services Tax Identification Number (GSTIN), TAN, MCA Corporate Identity Number (CIN).</li>
          <li><strong>Financial & Accounting Records:</strong> Sales and purchase invoices, bank statements, ledger balances, previous returns (ITR, GSTR-1, GSTR-3B, GSTR-9), TDS certificates, and audited balance sheets submitted for professional processing.</li>
          <li><strong>Website Usage Data:</strong> Anonymized server logs, browser type, device information, and interaction timestamps for site reliability and cyber safety.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          3. How We Use Your Data
        </h2>
        <p>Your data is processed strictly for legitimate professional purposes:</p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>Preparation, verification, and filing of statutory tax returns with government portals (Income Tax, GSTN, MCA, DGFT).</li>
          <li>Conducting statutory and internal audits, project financing consultations, and company incorporation filings.</li>
          <li>Responding to inquiries submitted via our contact forms or consultations.</li>
          <li>Transmitting important statutory compliance reminders and tax deadline alerts.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          4. Professional Confidentiality & Security
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under Clause (1) of Part I of the Second Schedule to the <em>Chartered Accountants Act 1949</em>, a Chartered Accountant in practice is bound to maintain strict client confidentiality. We do not disclose any confidential information acquired during professional engagements to third parties without specific client consent or statutory direction.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
          All digital transmissions use TLS encryption (HTTPS). Physical and cloud repositories are protected by enterprise-level firewalls, strict access controls, and regular backup mechanisms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          5. Third-Party Sharing Restrictions
        </h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, lease, or monetize your personal or financial information. Disclosure occurs only when:
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 25px; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li>Executing authorized filings on government portals (Income Tax e-filing, GST Portal, MCA21).</li>
          <li>Mandated by a court order, summons, or statutory investigation under applicable Indian laws.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          6. Document Retention
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the <em>Companies Act 2013</em> and Section 149 of the <em>Income Tax Act 1961</em>, financial records and audit documentation are maintained for a mandatory period of 8 years, following which they are securely archived or disposed of.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 12px;">
          7. Grievances and Contact
        </h2>
        <p>For inquiries, corrections, or concerns regarding your data, please contact:</p>
        <div style="background: #edf2f7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px;">
          <p><strong>CA Sanjay Bajaj</strong> — Proprietor</p>
          <p>S N Bajaj And Co., Chartered Accountants</p>
          <p>2007, Trade House, Opp. Man Darwaja Fire Station, Ring Road, Surat - 395002, Gujarat</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:casnbajaj2015@gmail.com" style="color: var(--primary-color);">casnbajaj2015@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919909831995" style="color: var(--primary-color);">+91 99098 31995</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</Base>
